      "source_hash": "sha256:f5899069b9bb8c49d524973f610e83ba2a9011c234e83fb4eae100ab920a1c80",
      "source_text": "Nursing autonomy does not mean isolation from other professional groups, but rather the ability to make independent, evidence-based decisions within one's own area of responsibility while actively participating in interprofessional collaboration. ->? (in Finnish)",
      "target_language": "ne",
      "localized_text": "नर्सिङ स्वायत्तताको अर्थ अन्य व्यावसायिक समूहहरूबाट अलग हुनु होइन, बरु आफ्नो जिम्मेवारीको क्षेत्रभित्र स्वतन्त्र, प्रमाण-आधारित निर्णयहरू गर्न सक्ने क्षमता हो, जबकि अन्तरव्यावसायिक सहकार्यमा सक्रिय रूपमा भाग लिनु पनि हो।",
      "translation_status": "translated",
